<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>기업 로그인</title>
</head>
<body>
{{>layout/header}}
{{>company/style}}
<main class="auth-page">
    <section class="auth-card company-card company-card--login">

        <h1>기업 로그인</h1>
        <p>기업 회원가입에 사용한 이메일로 로그인해주세요.</p>

        <form action="/company/login" method="post">
            <p>
                <label for="email">이메일</label><br>
                <input id="email"
                       name="email"
                       type="email"
                       autocomplete="username"
                       required>
            </p>

            <p>
                <label for="password">비밀번호</label><br>
                <input id="password"
                       name="password"
                       type="password"
                       autocomplete="current-password"
                       required>
            </p>

            <button type="submit">로그인</button>
        </form>

        <p>
            아직 회원이 아니신가요? <a href="/company/join">기업 회원가입</a>
        </p>
    </section>
</main>

{{>layout/footer}}
</body>
</html>